<title>USA: Channell Commercial Corp Q4 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Channell Commercial Corp Q4 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>TEMECULA, Calif. 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>CHANNELL COMMERCIAL CORPORATION</p>
<p>		 (Amounts in millions, except per share data)</p>
<p>					3 Months Ended  12 Months Ended</p>
<p>					  December 31    December 31</p>
<p>				   1996     1995	1996	 1995</p>
<p> Revenue		     12.088    9.205    47.282     40.972</p>
<p> Gross Profit		 5.777    4.254    21.812     17.913</p>
<p> Operating Profit	   3.373    1.956    13.178	9.171</p>
