<p>  Per Share**		   .23	.15	 .89	  .69</p>
<p>Period End Outstanding</p>
<p>  Shares***		   9.237    9.237     9.237	9.237</p>
<p>    *   Pro forma for the Company's conversion from an S</p>
<p>Corporation to a C Corporation upon the Company's Initial Public Offering.</p>
<p>**  Primarily excludes patent licensing expenses, which were terminated with the Company's Initial Public Offering and the benefit of the deferred tax.</p>
<p>*** Consists of 6,137,000 outstanding shares of common stock prior to the offering, 2,700,000 shares of common stock issued by the Company in the Initial Public Offering and 400,000 shares of common stock issued  by the exercise of the underwriter's over-allotment option.</p>
